Package: mattermost-ssl-auth
Version: __VERSION__
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: __MAINTAINER__
Depends: openresty, redis-server
Recommends: mattermost
Description: client-certificate auth reverse proxy for Mattermost
 Client-certificate (x509) single sign-on for Mattermost behind an
 OpenResty reverse proxy: the gateway maps the browser's client
 certificate to a Mattermost user, logs the user in server-side via
 the admin API, and replays the stored session on every request; the
 browser's cookie jar is kept in sync by the gateway itself, and
 access is granted by the client certificate, not by cookies.
 .
 OpenResty + Lua gateway; users are provisioned through the
 Mattermost admin API and per-user session state (cookies + token)
 is stored in Redis.
